
# Gig Economy Credit Scoring – Fintech Simulation

## Overview
GigScore Arena is a fintech simulation platform designed to evaluate creditworthiness of gig economy workers using alternative data.

## Problem
Gig workers face financial exclusion because traditional credit scoring models depend on fixed salaries and credit history.

## Solution
Develop an alternative credit scoring framework using gig platform behavioral data.

Key indicators used:
- Income stability
- Customer ratings
- Completion rate
- Platform tenure
- Activity patterns

## Artifacts
- Credit scoring framework
- Platform economics analysis
- Data architecture
- Simulation design
